## CQ-LT-01
@group client, new singleplayer world
@commands Create a world and watch the chunk progress screen
@pass Dark bar at the bottom, green "Tip:" and a white tip; a new tip about every 7 s; the bar does not cover the progress square
@fails No bar: grep latest.log for `Loading tips:`; 0 tips means the built-in packs were not found (`LoadingTipPacks`)
@draft no batch holds this row yet
