@commands Open an existing world; create a new one; `grep "Loading tips: bar on" logs/latest.log`
@pass Bar on "Reading world data" / "Preparing for world creation", the chunk screen and "Joining world"; the same tip across them, it changes only on the timer
@fails A screen missing from the grep list: note its class, add it to `startsJoin` / `continuesJoin` in `LoadingTipBar`
